  [PASS] E_(n,r) (direct count of words ending at max with r ladder epochs) == [t^n] L(t)^r for all n <= 14, r <= n
  [PASS] converse: every concatenation of r first-passage words ends at its maximum with exactly r ladder epochs (n <= 10, all tuples)
